{"n": 933, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "933.webp", "text": "51- 260\n\n5126000 REPLACING SWITCH FOR\nLEFT OR RIGHT FRONT DOOR\nLOCK (DRIVE)\n\nRemove door trim panel — see 51 41 001.\nPull off plastic sheet.\n\nJastallation:\n\nReplace damaged plastic sheet.\n\nUnscrew screws.\n\nPull off plug.\nDisengage drive.\nJnstallation:\nCheck identification.\nUpper Lower\nSection (1) Section (2)\nDriver's door white red\nPassenger’s door red red\nRear doors red white\nTrunk lid white red\n\n430 41645\n\n3051472\n\n3051473\n\nTroubleshooting central locks — see page\n\n51 - 800.\n\nJnstaliauion\n\n1. Lock in LOCKED position.\n\n2. Locking linkage in LOCKED position.\n\n3. Engage drive in connecting link and hold in\ninstalled position with a screw (screw is not\ntightened).\n\n4. Screw in second screw.\n\nCompress drive (position A), pull down\nslightly (linkage play) and then tighten screw\nwith 2 Nem (1.7 in, tbs.).\n\n5. Tighten the screw installed first.\n\nUpper section (1) faces\n\nforward in 2-door cars\n\nor\n\ntoward rear in 4-door cars.\n\nTwo Door Car Arrangement:\n1= Lock\n\n2 = Locking linkage/reverse\n\n3 = Door remote contro! linkage\n4 = Drive/connecting link\n\nFour Door Car Arrangement:\n\n1 = Lock\n\n2 = Locking linkage\n\n3 = Door remote control linkage\n4 = Drive/connecting link", "words": [["51-", 0.4686, 0.0285, 0.5015, 0.0517], ["260", 0.5071, 0.0272, 0.5436, 0.0504], ["5126000", 0.2568, 0.0663, 0.307, 0.0776], ["REPLACING", 0.3197, 0.0663, 0.3825, 0.0776], ["SWITCH", 0.386, 0.0663, 0.4276, 0.0776], ["FOR", 0.4316, 0.0663, 0.4534, 0.0776], ["LEFT", 0.3197, 0.0822, 0.3465, 0.0935], ["OR", 0.3501, 0.0822, 0.3658, 0.0935], ["RIGHT", 0.3703, 0.0822, 0.4048, 0.0935], ["FRONT", 0.4093, 0.0822, 0.4463, 0.0935], ["DOOR", 0.4498, 0.0822, 0.4823, 0.0935], ["LOCK", 0.3202, 0.0981, 0.349, 0.1094], ["(DRIVE)", 0.3531, 0.0981, 0.3951, 0.1101], ["Remove", 0.2579, 0.1306, 0.3734, 0.1432], ["door", 0.2994, 0.1273, 0.3197, 0.1459], ["trim", 0.3242, 0.1273, 0.3445, 0.145